{
    "title": "Lock Screen, Widgets - YoLock",
    "description": "You're feeling too bored with the default lock screens and want to customize them to express your personality. The OS18 lock screen app makes this easy. With many other features, you can create the most convenient and suitable lock screen for yourself.\r\nWith numerous special features, you can change and set up the lock screen to fit your phone and yourself. Many features help you customize your lock screen:\r\n<b>Change lock screen background</b> \r\n Choose from various interfaces and images, including themes like Technology, Movies, and Animations. You can even use your own images as lock screen wallpaper to see your favorite picture.\r\nYou can customize and create wallpapers with great widgets like the OS 18 widget or add additional widgets like weather widgets, music control widgets, and OS notification widgets\r\n\r\n<b>Unlock with PIN Code</b> \r\nSet your PIN code based on your favorite date of birth, anniversary, or favorite numbers.\r\n\r\n<b>Unlock with Password</b> :\r\nUse a password with both numbers and letters for higher security. The OS 18 lock screen app allows you to create a keyboard to enter your password easily.\r\n\r\n<b>Unlock with Face Recognition</b> \ud83e\uddcf\r\n Ensure security with face recognition, accurately scanning your face and unlocking quickly.\r\n\r\n<b>Unlock with Fingerprint</b> \ud83d\udc46\r\n Quickly scan your fingerprints to unlock your device, keeping your information safe.\r\n\r\n<b>Message and Call Notifications</b> \r\nReceive timely notifications without delays, and even set your device to read messages and respond quickly.\r\nIf you're looking forward to experiencing notifications like OS 18, you can simply choose within the OS 18 lock screen app to enjoy the full OS 18 widgets\r\n\r\n<b>Weather Notifications</b> \u2600\ufe0f\r\nStay updated with accurate weather forecasts to prepare for outings or choose appropriate clothing.\r\nYou can also customize the weather widget to resemble the OS 18 Widget right on the lock screen of your device. Especially with the OS 18 lock screen app, you can track not only your preferred location but also other favorite places, not just where you live. The weather widget also updates weather information for your area and intelligently plans activities for you\r\n\r\n<b>Change Clock and Clock Font</b> \u23f3\r\nCustomize the clock display with various designs, fonts, colors, and styles.\r\nIf you're a fan of the OS 18 clock widget, you can easily access it by going into the app and selecting the OS 18 clock template, then use it effortlessly with the OS 18 widget\r\n\r\n<b>Switch from Lock Screen to Camera </b> \ud83d\udcf8\r\nQuickly capture beautiful moments by swiping from left to right to access the camera.\r\n\r\n<b>Switch from Lock Screen to Contacts</b> \ud83d\udc49\r\nEasily access your contacts to find and contact people for work.\r\n\r\n<b>Adjust Music on the Lock Screen</b> \ud83c\udfb5\r\nChange songs directly on the lock screen with all song information displayed accurately.\r\nYou can also customize or adjust the music control widget to be like the OS 18 Music Control Widget easily. The OS 18 Music Control Widget allows users to manage song playback, pause, adjust volume, and more directly from the lock screen or home screen through the OS 18 lock screen app\r\n\r\n<b>API Accessibility Services</b>\r\nThis app uses API AccessibilityServices\r\nThis application requires activation in the accessibility service to display the lock screen view on the mobile screen. Additionally, this app utilizes accessibility service functionalities such as control music, control volume, and dismissing system dialogs, among other features.\r\n 1- This application does not accumulate or disclose any user information about this accessibility right.\r\n2- No user data is stored by this application about this accessibility right.\r\nWe do not sell, trade or otherwise transfer your personally identifiable information to outside parties. Please grant this permission to use these actions: Go to Settings > Accessibility > Services and turn on Lock Screen",
    "descriptionHTML": "You&#39;re feeling too bored with the default lock screens and want to customize them to express your personality. The OS18 lock screen app makes this easy. With many other features, you can create the most convenient and suitable lock screen for yourself.<br>With numerous special features, you can change and set up the lock screen to fit your phone and yourself. Many features help you customize your lock screen:<br><b>Change lock screen background</b> <br> Choose from various interfaces and images, including themes like Technology, Movies, and Animations. You can even use your own images as lock screen wallpaper to see your favorite picture.<br>You can customize and create wallpapers with great widgets like the OS 18 widget or add additional widgets like weather widgets, music control widgets, and OS notification widgets<br><br><b>Unlock with PIN Code</b> <br>Set your PIN code based on your favorite date of birth, anniversary, or favorite numbers.<br><br><b>Unlock with Password</b> :<br>Use a password with both numbers and letters for higher security. The OS 18 lock screen app allows you to create a keyboard to enter your password easily.<br><br><b>Unlock with Face Recognition</b> \ud83e\uddcf<br> Ensure security with face recognition, accurately scanning your face and unlocking quickly.<br><br><b>Unlock with Fingerprint</b> \ud83d\udc46<br> Quickly scan your fingerprints to unlock your device, keeping your information safe.<br><br><b>Message and Call Notifications</b> <br>Receive timely notifications without delays, and even set your device to read messages and respond quickly.<br>If you&#39;re looking forward to experiencing notifications like OS 18, you can simply choose within the OS 18 lock screen app to enjoy the full OS 18 widgets<br><br><b>Weather Notifications</b> \u2600\ufe0f<br>Stay updated with accurate weather forecasts to prepare for outings or choose appropriate clothing.<br>You can also customize the weather widget to resemble the OS 18 Widget right on the lock screen of your device. Especially with the OS 18 lock screen app, you can track not only your preferred location but also other favorite places, not just where you live. The weather widget also updates weather information for your area and intelligently plans activities for you<br><br><b>Change Clock and Clock Font</b> \u23f3<br>Customize the clock display with various designs, fonts, colors, and styles.<br>If you&#39;re a fan of the OS 18 clock widget, you can easily access it by going into the app and selecting the OS 18 clock template, then use it effortlessly with the OS 18 widget<br><br><b>Switch from Lock Screen to Camera </b> \ud83d\udcf8<br>Quickly capture beautiful moments by swiping from left to right to access the camera.<br><br><b>Switch from Lock Screen to Contacts</b> \ud83d\udc49<br>Easily access your contacts to find and contact people for work.<br><br><b>Adjust Music on the Lock Screen</b> \ud83c\udfb5<br>Change songs directly on the lock screen with all song information displayed accurately.<br>You can also customize or adjust the music control widget to be like the OS 18 Music Control Widget easily. The OS 18 Music Control Widget allows users to manage song playback, pause, adjust volume, and more directly from the lock screen or home screen through the OS 18 lock screen app<br><br><b>API Accessibility Services</b><br>This app uses API AccessibilityServices<br>This application requires activation in the accessibility service to display the lock screen view on the mobile screen. Additionally, this app utilizes accessibility service functionalities such as control music, control volume, and dismissing system dialogs, among other features.<br> 1- This application does not accumulate or disclose any user information about this accessibility right.<br>2- No user data is stored by this application about this accessibility right.<br>We do not sell, trade or otherwise transfer your personally identifiable information to outside parties. Please grant this permission to use these actions: Go to Settings &gt; Accessibility &gt; Services and turn on Lock Screen",
